menu "S3Wear core (sys_core)"

    config S3W_LVGL_THREAD_CHECK
        bool "Assert on LVGL access without lv_lock()"
        default y
        help
            Debug aid: the LVGL port aborts with a backtrace when an LVGL object is
            invalidated or LVGL memory is allocated by a task that does not hold
            lv_lock() (the UI task always does). Off in release builds.

endmenu
